{"chars": "Then she opened her sketchbook to her drawing of the Ice Orchid, there in the starlight, and this time she knew what to look for. She had drawn the Ice Orchid from the front: five narrow petals spreading out like a star, every one the same distance from the next, all held in perfect balance around the round, frilly cup of her lip. Not too early and not too late, not too much on one side or the other. A star, perfectly balanced.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.45, 0.45, 0.45, 0.45, 0.575, 0.575, 0.575, 0.575, 0.575, 0.575, 0.575, 0.912, 0.912, 0.912, 0.912, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.025, 1.55, 1.55, 1.55, 1.637, 1.637, 1.637, 1.637, 1.788, 1.788, 1.788, 1.788, 1.788, 1.788, 1.788, 1.788, 2.163, 2.163, 2.163, 2.237, 2.237, 2.237, 2.237, 2.388, 2.388, 2.388, 2.388, 2.675, 2.675, 2.675, 2.675, 2.675, 2.675, 2.675, 3.35, 3.45, 3.45, 3.45, 3.45, 3.45, 3.45, 3.625, 3.625, 3.625, 3.712, 3.712, 3.712, 3.712, 3.812, 3.812, 3.812, 3.812, 3.812, 3.812, 3.812, 3.812, 3.812, 3.812, 4.65, 4.75, 4.75, 4.75, 4.75, 4.862, 4.862, 4.862, 4.862, 4.862, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.388, 5.388, 5.388, 5.388, 5.55, 5.55, 5.55, 5.55, 5.55, 5.725, 5.725, 5.725, 5.725, 5.725, 5.875, 5.875, 5.875, 6.0, 6.0, 6.0, 6.0, 6.0, 6.225, 6.225, 6.225, 6.225, 6.875, 7.0, 7.0, 7.0, 7.0, 7.138, 7.138, 7.138, 7.138, 7.25, 7.25, 7.25, 7.25, 7.25, 7.25, 7.487, 7.487, 7.487, 7.487, 7.612, 7.612, 7.612, 7.612, 7.875, 7.875, 7.875, 7.875, 7.875, 7.875, 7.875, 8.225, 8.225, 8.225, 8.225, 8.225, 8.363, 8.363, 8.363, 8.363, 8.463, 8.463, 8.463, 8.463, 8.463, 8.463, 9.025, 9.137, 9.137, 9.137, 9.137, 9.137, 9.475, 9.475, 9.475, 9.475, 9.475, 9.475, 9.475, 9.825, 9.825, 9.825, 9.825, 9.825, 9.825, 9.825, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.225, 10.65, 10.65, 10.65, 10.65, 10.838, 10.838, 10.838, 10.838, 10.838, 11.012, 11.012, 11.113, 11.113, 11.113, 11.113, 11.113, 11.725, 11.825, 11.825, 11.825, 11.825, 11.825,